    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nThe Shackleton, at the Mariner's Point development, are remarkable new homes that showcase a perfect blend of thoughtful design and contemporary style, meticulously crafted to embody the essence of coastal living. The master and top floor ensuite bedrooms have been positioned to offer stunning sea views. Plus, the 9 ft ground floor-to-ceiling heights add an extra touch of spaciousness and luxury to these coastal retreats, further enhancing the overall living experience provided by Ardale.\n\nMariners Point is Ardale's latest venture in Wicklow Town. The development includes a variety of 3 & 4 bedroom luxury family homes ideally nestled between the Wicklow mountains and the Irish Sea. Designed as the heart of an ever-evolving community, these top-tier homes cater to families with grand aspirations and expansive plans, complemented by stunning coastal vistas.\n\nWicklow Town is undeniably scenic, where the Irish Sea meets the Wicklow Mountains. Wicklow's title as the Garden of Ireland is well-earned, and you can immerse yourself in its charm. It's a place ripe with possibilities, offering a healthier way of life, nurturing new bonds, and embracing you into a community that feels like family.\n\nFor those who yearn for open spaces and revitalizing air, Mariners Point is the idyllic spot to establish roots. It offers seamless connectivity to Dublin City without its incessant buzz, making it an ideal locale for ambitious families to pursue their s while enjoying the embrace of nature. If you're seeking the comforting pulse of town life coupled with essential amenities, Mariners Point undoubtedly feels like hom"
      },
      {
